```

#### Font Tokens (3, injected by next/font):
```css
--font-design-primary
--font-design-secondary
--font-design-mono
```

---

### 2. INTERACTION LANGUAGE

The design system establishes a clear semantic progression:
- **Neutral** (default state)
- **Accent** (hover/anticipation) - used on hover states
- **Primary** (active/selected/committed) - buttons, CTAs, selected chips, progress

**Example flow**: Buttons start neutral → accent on hover → primary when selected/active

---

### 3. THEME ARCHITECTURE PATTERN

Each design defines its own theme file scoped by `[data-design="N"]`:

**File structure**:
```
/packages/designs/NN/src/theme.css
```

**Pattern**: Multiple theme declarations within single file, overriding root tokens:

```css
[data-design="4"],
[data-design="4"][data-theme="dark"] {
  --design-bg: oklch(0.05 0 0);
  --design-fg: oklch(0.98 0 0);
  /* ... all 31+ tokens ... */
}

[data-design="4"][data-theme="light"] {
  --design-bg: oklch(0.96 0.015 85);
  --design-fg: oklch(0.15 0 0);
  /* ... theme-specific overrides ... */
}
```

**Key observations**:
- Uses **OKLCH color space** (not hex/rgb) for semantic, perceptually-uniform colors
- Supports **light/dark theme variants** via `data-theme` attribute
- Allows **extended design-specific tokens** (e.g., LED indicators, LCD displays, brushed metal textures)
- **Fallback tokens** defined at `:root` for pages outside `[data-design]` scope

---

### 4. TOKEN NAMING CONVENTION

**Pattern**: `--design-[semantic-name][-variant]`

Examples from actual usage:
- `--design-bg` (background)
- `--design-card-fg` (foreground text on card)
- `--design-primary-fg` (foreground on primary)
- `--design-led-green` (design-specific LED status)
- `--design-record-hover` (design-specific record button states)
- `--design-watermark-opacity` (design-specific extended property)

---

### 5. ANIMATION KEYFRAMES (Complete List)

All animations use `@keyframes` and respect `prefers-reduced-motion`:

#### Batch & Selection:
```css
@keyframes ds-batch-pulse {
  0%, 100% { transform: scale(1); }
  50% { transform: scale(1.3); }
}
```

#### Generation Bar:
```css
@keyframes ds-gen-breathe {
  0%, 100% {
    box-shadow:
      0 0 0 0 color-mix(in oklch, var(--design-accent), transparent 90%),
      inset 0 0 20px color-mix(in oklch, var(--design-accent), transparent 95%);
  }
  50% {
    box-shadow:
      0 0 20px 2px color-mix(in oklch, var(--design-accent), transparent 80%),
      inset 0 0 30px color-mix(in oklch, var(--design-accent), transparent 90%);
  }
}

@keyframes ds-gen-progress {
  from { width: 0%; }
  to { width: 100%; }
}

@keyframes ds-controls-reveal {
  from {
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(-10px);
  }
  to {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: translateY(0);
  }
}
```

#### Image Lightbox:
```css
@keyframes ds-lightbox-fade-in {
  from { opacity: 0; }
  to { opacity: 1; }
}

@keyframes ds-lightbox-scale-in {
  from {
    opacity: 0;
    transform: scale(0.95);
  }
  to {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: scale(1);
  }
}

@keyframes ds-sibling-spin {
  to { transform: rotate(360deg); }
}

@keyframes ds-failed-image-spin {
  to { transform: rotate(360deg); }
}
```

#### Skeleton/Loading:
```css
@keyframes ds-skeleton-progress-sweep {
  0% {
    transform: translateX(-100%);
    left: 0;
  }
  100% {
    transform: translateX(100%);
    left: 100%;
  }
}

@keyframes ds-skeleton-shimmer {
  0% { background-position: 200% 0; }
  100% { background-position: -200% 0; }
}
```

#### Onboarding:
```css
@keyframes ds-onboarding-bounce {
  0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0); }
  50% { transform: translateY(-4px); }
}

@keyframes ds-onboarding-point {
  0%, 100% { transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(0); }
  50% { transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(-6px); }
}
```

#### Style Switcher:
```css
@keyframes ds-style-panel-in {
  from {
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(8px) scale(0.96);
  }
  to {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: translateY(0) scale(1);
  }
}
```

#### Workflow Progress:
```css
@keyframes ds-workflow-shimmer {
  0% { background-position: 200% 0; }
  100% { background-position: -200% 0; }
}
```

**Common durations**: 300ms (controls), 2s (shimmer), 3s (breathing), 1.5s (progress sweep), 600ms (image zoom)

